  "description": "[Meet 'Crayon Little Dino' – Your Child's First Dinosaur Friend!] The latest installment in the popular 'Crayon' series is finally here! This time, we’re traveling back to the mysterious age of dinosaurs. From T-Rex to Triceratops, the adorable baby dinosaurs kids love are waiting for your colorful touch.\n\nFeatures:\n\nAnimated Dino Encyclopedia: Decorate over 16 different dinosaurs with your favorite colors. Once finished, they come to life with vivid reactions!\n\nDiverse Artistic Tools: Use a wide range of crayon colors to let your child's imagination run wild.\n\nStress-Free Play: No rules, no time limits. Designed for kids to explore at their own pace and feel a sense of achievement.\n\nWhy It's Special: The intuitive UI, proven through the 'Crayon' series, allows even children who can't read yet to enjoy the game on their own. More than just a game, it’s the ultimate art content to develop color sense and concentration.",
